L19_1 = "<color=#ffd34c>\226\150\160\226\150\160</color> Wyler. LOL! You're done for. HAHAHA!\n<color=#ffd34c>\226\150\160\226\150\160\226\150\160</color> Well, say goodbye to your involuntary manslaughter claim. HAHAHA!\n<color=#ffd34c>\226\150\160\226\150\160\226\150\160</color> Ugh, that's the Gauntlet's ace? You're better off behind bars. HAHA!\n<color=#ffd34c>\226\150\160 \226\150\160</color> You gotta be smart to not get caught while cheating. LMAO!\n<color=#ffd34c>\226\150\160 \226\150\160</color> He's nothing but a trashy psycho killer. LOL!\n<color=#ffd34c>\226\150\160\226\150\160\226\150\160\226\150\160</color> I knew something about today's match felt weird...\n<color=#ffd34c>\226\150\160\226\150\160\226\150\160\226\150\160</color> Now we gotta dig into whom his sponsors are.\n<color=#ffd34c>\226\150\160 \226\150\160\226\150\160</color> I just got goosebumps. He just admitted to using real bullets.\n<color=#ffd34c>\226\150\160 \226\150\160</color> Even if the Gauntlet is all about who sponsors you, this is way out of line.\n<color=#ffd34c>\226\150\160\226\150\160</color> It's amazing that Canary Squad was even able to keep fighting in such horrible conditions."
